{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Eio_unix.Backend_config</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"eio","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Eio_unix","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Backend_config","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"eio_linux","href":"#eio_linux","children":[]},{"title":"Generic types","href":"#generic-types","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Configuration settings to pass to <code>Eio_main.run</code>.</p><p>Unknown settings are ignored, so you can pass options for e.g. <code>Eio_linux.run</code> and they will be ignored if <code>Eio_posix</code> is used instead.</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"since\"><span class=\"at-tag\">since</span> 1.7</li></ul>","content":"<h3 id=\"eio_linux\"><a href=\"#eio_linux\" class=\"anchor\"></a>eio_linux</h3><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-fixed_buffer\"><a href=\"#type-fixed_buffer\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> fixed_buffer</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-fixed_buffer.n_blocks\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-fixed_buffer.n_blocks\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>n_blocks : int;</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>The number of fixed buffer chunks to allocate.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-fixed_buffer.block_size\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-fixed_buffer.block_size\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>block_size : int;</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>The size of each fixed buffer chunk.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-linux\"><a href=\"#type-linux\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> linux</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-linux.Uring_queue_depth\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-linux.Uring_queue_depth\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Uring_queue_depth <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> int</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>The number of jobs that can be submitted in one batch.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-linux.Uring_fixed_buffer\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-linux.Uring_fixed_buffer\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Uring_fixed_buffer <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> <span><a href=\"#type-fixed_buffer\">fixed_buffer</a> option</span></span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Use a fixed buffer to speed things up, if possible. If there isn't enough locked memory available, this is ignored.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-linux.Uring_polling_timeout\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-linux.Uring_polling_timeout\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Uring_polling_timeout <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> <span>int option</span></span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>How long (in ms) to continue polling when there's nothing to do. If <code>None</code>, polling isn't used.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Options recognised by the <code>Eio_linux</code> backend.</p></div></div><h3 id=\"generic-types\"><a href=\"#generic-types\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Generic types</h3><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-setting\"><a href=\"#type-setting\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> setting</span><span> = <a href=\"#type-linux\">linux</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Currently, only eio_linux has any settings.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = <span><a href=\"#type-setting\">setting</a> list</span></span></code></div></div>"}